[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14465.99, "timestamp": "04:01:05", "text": "罗马尼亚，梦想，羽毛，操作系统破坏者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14468.15, "timestamp": "04:01:08", "text": "我的意思是，我想要弓箭，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14470.15, "timestamp": "04:01:10", "text": "诚实地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14473.67, "timestamp": "04:01:13", "text": "我真的想要那把弓。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14476.469, "timestamp": "04:01:16", "text": "这些所以我很喜欢弓箭角色，弓箭"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14480.63, "timestamp": "04:01:20", "text": "武器。所以，这是弓的活力，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14482.95, "timestamp": "04:01:22", "text": "一个粉红色的蝴蝶结。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14484.55, "timestamp": "04:01:24", "text": "等等，这其实跟我……很搭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14489.429, "timestamp": "04:01:29", "text": "像Jockn的配色方案一样有个性。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14491.83, "timestamp": "04:01:31", "text": "那是紫色的蝴蝶结吗？我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14494.79, "timestamp": "04:01:34", "text": "太棒了。我的天哪，他们有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14497.91, "timestamp": "04:01:37", "text": "迷你炮发射器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14516.87, "timestamp": "04:01:56", "text": "[音乐]"}]